{"id": "182102", "name": "טור טיילור של ln(ax) סביב נקודה – ארבעה איברים ראשונים (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>By writing \\(x\\) as \\({{CT:0}}+(x-{{CT:0}})\\) and using the Maclaurin expansion for \\(\\ln(1+t)\\), or otherwise, find the first four non zero terms in the Taylor series expansion for</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln({{CT:1}}x) \\]</p><p>about \\(x = {{CT:0}}\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">Use exact expressions, i.e. enter \\(\\ln(5)\\) rather than \\(1.609...\\).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Write the logarithm as a constant plus \\(\\ln(1+t)\\) with \\(t\\) small near the point, then use the Maclaurin series of \\(\\ln(1+t)\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Rewriting about the point</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln({{CT:1}}x) \\]</p>can be written as<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln({{CT:1}}({{CT:0}}+(x-{{CT:0}}))) \\]</p>which equals<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln{{CT:1}} + \\ln({{CT:0}}+(x-{{CT:0}})) =\\ln{{CT:1}} + \\ln\\left({{CT:0}}\\left(1+\\frac{(x-{{CT:0}})}{{CT:0}}\\right)\\right)=\\ln{{CT:1}} + \\ln{{CT:0}}+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac{(x-{{CT:0}})}{{CT:0}}\\right) \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The series of ln(1+t)</b><br>As \\(\\ln(1+t) = t-\\frac{t^2}{2}+\\frac{t^3}{3}\\) and \\(\\ln{{CT:1}} + \\ln{{CT:0}} =\\ln({{CT:2}})\\),<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln({{CT:1}}x)= \\ln({{CT:2}})+\\frac{x-{{CT:0}}}{{CT:0}}-\\frac{(x-{{CT:0}})^2}{{CT:3}}+\\frac{(x-{{CT:0}})^3}{{CT:4}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">[[feedback:Result]]</span></p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff, taylor,sum,solve", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f", "n1", "n2", "wronganswer1"], "nvariants": 16}